{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は弟が都内に用事があって\n来てたからその帰りに\n私のお家に遊びに来たよ〜(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段そっけないけど昨日は\nそこそこ喋ってくれました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹空いた〜って言われて\n冷蔵庫を覗いたらオムライス\n作れそうだったので作りました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/03/7055279/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弟があんまりケチャップ\n好きじゃないので自己流の\nデミグラスソース(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜にこんなの載せたから\nお腹空いたじゃんかー！\nって人、手挙げてっ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構量多めに作っちゃったんだけど\n美味しいって完食してくれて\n嬉しかったです(｡-ω-)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃は掴み合いの喧嘩とか\nしてたけど大人になると\n改めて兄弟の大切さを感じるなぁと\nしみじみ思いました(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2015/04/03/7055279/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなち☆じょしらくおめでと〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろに写ってる伊織が\n笑顔全開ヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日・明後日は\n名古屋で透明な色の握手会と\n京都で命は美しいの握手会(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーーーいっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日連続で来てくれる方も\nどちらか片方の方も\nたくさんたくさんラブラブ\nしましょっ(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"brea